// Dialog :
"P13098585" "What was going on over there? Dr. Aeon was the one trying to stop you? That's nuts! We gotta get to the bottom of this. Lord Recluse ain't gonna be happy with anything holding up his destiny!"
// RandomFameString :
"P3599821687" "Why are Arachnos troops calling {VillainName} the 'Destined One'?"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2137412996" "Whatever Doc Aeon's up to, it needs to be stopped. Operation: Destiny is too big for him to mess around. Aeon's got protection, but you're the Destined One, right? So, if you <A HREF={ACCEPT}>tell Arbiter Daos about Dr. Aeon's interference, he's got to listen and give you permission to bring Dr. Aeon in.</A>"
// AcceptString :
"P4249316673" "Talk to Arbiter Daos, then catch Dr. Aeon."
// SendOffString :
"P1530983999" "Once you have the word from Daos, go in and grab Dr. Aeon."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part1 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P4264124142" "Talk to Arbiter Daos"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P2958248228" "You need to talk to Arbiter Daos, then catch Dr. Aeon!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P727262109" "This accusation against Dr. Aeon is dire, but not unfounded. And considering your status as the Destined One, I must investigate it. {VillainName}, I grant you the authority to capture and question Dr. Aeon. Find out what part he had in all of this."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission2_Part2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3345008734" "Catch Dr. Aeon"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1783852532" "I got word. Daos says it's on. I kinda wish I could go in with you, I'd love to wipe the smirk off that smart-guy's face."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P1007563710" "Where ever Dr. Aeon may be hiding, you'll find him and get the answers you need."

