// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Objective - Safe2 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - Objective 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - TaskSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P3641564186" ""You found the information you were looking for."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P825857171" "So, after you hit that base, alarms went off all over the place. Turns out that those journals you stole belong to Lord Recluse. I'll set up some patsy as the thief, after I copy 'em and get 'em translated by some people I can trust. Hey, I want to see 'em too. But you need to be seen to keep suspicion off you. Fortunately, they're ready to try the portal again."
// RandomFameString :
"P3089041073" "I heard someone stole some of Lord Recluse's personal journals! That's a brave soul!"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission4 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P2139743031" "They think they've finally got a time portal that can go past Recluse's Victory, so Lord Recluse can find out exactly how you help him win and what will come after. You're supposed to <A HREF={ACCEPT}>go through the portal, see what happened to the future, and then head back</A>. <br><br>And while you're checking that out, I'll get those journals decoded."
// AcceptString :
"P2582556299" "Visit the future you will help create."
// SendOffString :
"P3349101925" "I got no idea what you'll find there, but I'll make you a deal. I'll tell Silver Mantis to be ready to meet you now, so she'll remember to be there to meet you then. That way, no matter what happens, you'll have someone there to tell you the truth about what's going on. Oh, and I figure Doc Aeon will also be there, you might want to see if you can squeeze some info out of him."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P2074774284" "Visit the future"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P3759057133" "Look, I don't really get this time-stuff. Just find Mantis and Aeon, they should be able to explain what's going on."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2084169572" "You expected fanfares and parades. Not the end of the world."

